# Manual label writing — flow + unnecessary text

Learned **2026-09-16**. Owner asked to inspect admin “manual label writing” for leftover text.

## Flow (precise)

**There is no separate admin WYSIWYG label-text editor.**

1. Admin configures products / Mixed Labels hints / sample sheet images under `/admin/products` (+ stickers).
2. Actual name/phrase typing uses **storefront customize** (admin may open the same URLs to test):
   - `/stickers/customize` — grid name stickers (`Emily` default)
   - `/stickers/customize/mixed` — Mixed Labels name field
   - `/stamp/customize` — stamp text (`Your Name` default)
   - `/custom-design` — Custom Design Studio
   - `/stickers/custom` — Bespoke **request form** (not live sheet editor)
3. `EditStageModal` watermark = **media** watermark, not name-label copy.
4. Invoice / AusPost PDFs ≠ sticker name sheets.

## Unnecessary / inconsistent text (inspection)

### P0 — clear leftovers

| Text | Where | Why unnecessary / wrong |
|------|-------|-------------------------|
| Preview fallback **`네임 스티커`** | `components/CustomizationModal.tsx` | Storefront default is English; Korean hardcode when text empty |
| Broken / mismatched `t('custom.*')` keys vs `translations` `customize.*` | Same modal | Shows raw keys or wrong labels; modal overlaps `/stickers/customize` |
| Dead Mixed overlay pipeline | `MixedLabelsSheetPreview.tsx`, `lib/mixedLabelsPreviewImage.ts` | **0 imports** — Name-only preview replaced them; dead copy/comments |

### P1 — inconsistent sample / helper (confusing, not always “delete”)

| Text | Where | Issue |
|------|-------|--------|
| Default **`Emily`** vs **`Your Name`** vs empty + `e.g. Emily or 지우` | stickers customize / stamp / Mixed | Same product family, different preview defaults |
| Font guide **`Hello` / `Selpic`** (stamp: `안녕하세요 Hello`) | Font Style Guide blocks | Not customer input; can be confused with live sheet text |
| Product select fills ``${product.name}\nCustomText`` | Custom Design Studio | Product title dumped into label lines |
| Phone “up to **10**” vs “up to **9**” chars | stickers vs custom-design | Inconsistent helper |
| Admin “sample sheet with placeholder name” / “until customize preview is live” | Mixed Labels admin copy | May be stale if preview is already live |

### P2 — developer / legacy exposure

| Text | Where | Why |
|------|-------|-----|
| **`Form UX v5`** + hard-refresh hint | `app/stickers/custom/page.tsx` | **Removed from customer UI** (2026-09-21). QA marker is `data-bespoke-ux="revision-v5"` on the admin-review sentence only. |
| Legacy **Custom Stickers** strings | CMS migrate + invoice sample lines | Rebranded to Bespoke; leftovers elsewhere |
| `NAME_LABEL_PREVIEW.md` | under customize | Learning doc only — not runtime |

## Do / Do not when cleaning

**Do:** Fix P0 English + remove or quarantine dead Mixed preview modules; unify sample name if product asks.  
**Do not:** Strip Font Guide samples without owner OK (intentional). Do not treat shipping/invoice PDF strings as name-label bugs. Do not redesign Hero while cleaning customize copy.

